            <name>Production Metric (BCU-equivalent)</name>
            <visibility>0</visibility>
            <description>BCU-equivalent economic output tiers:

&gt;5000B BCU: Major Power
&gt;1000B BCU: Major Economy
&gt;200B BCU: Intermediate Economy
&gt;20B BCU: Small Economy
